  "details": "With the release of improvements to the avatar system and changes made to accommodate the avatar sales system, **the issue of inconsistent performance rankings has worsened.¹**\n\nThere are now **three** separate ranking stats shown for a singular avatar, and **only one of them is correct.**\n\nTake the details from the pictured avatar. It is of \"good\" rank, on PC, and Poor rank on other platforms. **According to VRCHAT.com, it is poor everywhere, and even worse, the Performance Breakdown in the UI ranks it as Very Poor on all platforms. This is significantly incorrect.**\n\nWith the introduction of the ability to find and purchase avatars in-client, **it is imperative that users know what they are purchasing. An incorrect ranking could severely impact a creator's ability to make sales, as users may incorrectly trust these metrics, and pass on avatars that have been erroneously ranked between 1 & 3 ranks worse than they actually are.**\n\n1. https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/performance-rankings-are-not-consistent",
